 *   max_iter     (default 300)          — EM iteration cap.
 *   init         (default "kmeans++")   — "random" / "kmeans++".
 *   n_init       (default 10)           — random restarts, best-inertia wins.
 *   tol          (default 1e-4)         — convergence tolerance.
